@startuml CU-18
actor "Encargado de sucursal" as Stf
boundary "«UI» Angular (gestión de reservas)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /reservations" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» ReservationService / Reservation / Inventory" as Model

Stf -> UI : Abre el listado de reservas recibidas
UI -> Ctrl : GET /reservations?status=
Ctrl -> Model : list_staff(db, user, status?) → valida rol/empleado
Model --> Ctrl : list[ReservationRead]
Ctrl --> UI : list[ReservationRead]
UI --> Stf : Reservas de la sucursal

Stf -> UI : Marca como preparadas las prendas reservadas
UI -> Ctrl : PATCH /reservations/{id}/status (PREPARED)
Ctrl -> Model : transition(PENDING → PREPARED)
Model --> Ctrl : ReservationRead (PREPARED)
Ctrl --> UI : ReservationRead
UI --> Stf : Prendas preparadas para probar

@enduml